<title>UK: BFI slips on weaker mid-July panamax vessels.</title>
<headline>BFI slips on weaker mid-July panamax vessels.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index (BFI) fell three points to 1,283 on the back of weaker conditions for panamax vessels from mid-July.</p>
<p>Brokers reported a likely softening for rates for panamaxes in the Pacific.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542-8075</p>
